{"id": "q0400", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So, people travel to islands for a holiday because they're looking for something different from their everyday lives. They want to escape the hustle and bustle of city life and find peace and tranquility. Islands offer beautiful natural scenery like beaches, ocean s, and tropical forests, which are perfect for relaxation and adventure. Plus, island s often have unique culture s and traditions that attract curious travelers who enjoy learning about new places and people. It' s all about getting away from it all and enjoying nature.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0404", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Easter is a holiday that's celebrated in many different ways. Some people celebrate it by going to church, others by having an Easter egg hunt, and still others by spending time with family and friends.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0412", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The longest play by William Shakespeare is Ham let. It's a tragedy that features Prince Hamlet of Denmark seeking revenge against his uncle Claud ius, who murdered the king and married Hamlet's mother. The play is known for its complex characters, philosophical themes, and famous lines like \" To be or not to be.\" Its length makes it one of the most challenging but also most profound works in Shakes peare's canon.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0418", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The colors are often inspired by Pan Africanism, which is a political and cultural movement that promotes unity and solidarity among people of African descent. The color s red, black, and green are the most common on these flags because they symbolize the struggle for freedom, the rich heritage of Africa, and the hope for a better future, respectively. Many countries also incorporate additional colors or patterns to represent their unique national identity or historical events.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 28, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0427", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, you could do a lot of things. You can go to the Golden Gate Bridge and take pictures of it. Or you could go to Alcatraz Island and see where some people were kept as prisoners for many years.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0432", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 13, "onset_chunk": 12, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, one thing that you can do is to stretch your hip flexors. You can also try sitting on a stability ball or an exercise ball for a while during the day. That will help keep your spine aligned and prevent any discomfort.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0439", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "There are several things you can do with used brake rotors, depending on their condition and local regulations. Here are some options: 1. Re cycle them at an auto parts recycler or scrap yard that accept s metal. Many facilities accept fer rous metals like steel, which is what most brake rotors are made from.2. Donate them to a mechanic or auto shop if they need spare parts for repair work. Some shops might use older rotors in testing or training.3. Check with your local ho neycombers or scrap metal dealers to see if they buy or trade for used auto parts. 4. If the rot ors still have good material left, you might be able to resurface them yourself or take them to a machine shop to restore them for reuse.5. Make sure not to leave them out where they could pose a hazard or cause damage. Always follow local environmental guidelines for dispose al.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 43, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0443", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Chicago has two professional football teams. The Chicago Bear s play in the NFL and the Chicago Rush play in the USL Championship, which is a second-tier league in American soccer.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0449", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So the Royal Navy did a really good job of protecting their ships, but they didn't have much protection against the Arg entine air attacks. And so what happened was that they actually had to take out some of these aircraft carrier s because they were being attacked by these Arg entine planes. But then once they took out those aircraft carriers, they could no longer protect themselves from the Argentine air attacks.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
