{"id": "q0465", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A credit card is a plastic card that allows you to borrow money from a bank or financial institution to make purchases. You can use it for things like buying groceries, dining out, or online shopping. The key thing is that you pay the bank back later, usually with interest if you don’t pay it off in full by the due date. Credit cards also offer rewards programs and help build your credit history when used responsibly.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 23, "carrier_ended": null}
